00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:41,565
‎Ranma.

238
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:49,657
‎Thief!

239
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,875
<i>‎Shit. Did he see through my disguise?</i>

240
00:16:00,876 --> 00:16:03,503
<i>‎I thought it was perfect.</i>

241
00:16:03,504 --> 00:16:05,004
‎I'm so sorry!

242
00:16:05,005 --> 00:16:06,799
‎I thought you were Ranma.

243
00:16:07,716 --> 00:16:10,009
‎You're so horrible.

244
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:12,262
‎I didn't do anything.

245
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,555
‎I'm sorry!

246
00:16:14,556 --> 00:16:16,100
‎Truly sorry!

247
00:16:17,601 --> 00:16:18,602
‎But...

248
00:16:23,107 --> 00:16:24,315
‎I like you.

249
00:16:24,316 --> 00:16:26,150
‎What? Huh? Wait.

250
00:16:26,151 --> 00:16:28,528
‎We just met, how can...

251
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:31,447
‎Do you hate girls with glasses?

252
00:16:31,448 --> 00:16:33,658
‎No... but...

253
00:16:33,659 --> 00:16:35,660
‎I have someone I love...

254
00:16:35,661 --> 00:16:37,203
‎I don't mind.

255
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:38,496
‎But...

256
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:39,665
‎Really?

257
00:16:40,958 --> 00:16:42,375
‎It's lights out for you!

258
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:44,877
‎What are you doing?

259
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:48,214
‎Akane. You've got it wrong.

260
00:16:48,215 --> 00:16:49,841
‎I didn't do anything---

261
00:16:49,842 --> 00:16:52,760
{\an8}‎Hey, Akane! Why do you have
‎to keep getting in my way?

262
00:16:52,761 --> 00:16:57,306
‎Ranma. You'd do something this shameful
‎just to get your hands on some underwear?

263
00:16:57,307 --> 00:17:00,685
{\an8}‎You idiot. I don't care
‎about the underwear.

264
00:17:00,686 --> 00:17:01,937
{\an8}‎You want them, right?

265
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,523
‎I'll give them all to you.

266
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:09,277
‎They're all ones we got
‎to use in a trap anyway.

267
00:17:09,278 --> 00:17:10,737
‎Listen to me...

268
00:17:10,738 --> 00:17:13,741
‎So, please.

269
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:16,452
‎Stop breaking any more laws.

270
00:17:17,202 --> 00:17:20,372
‎I truly believed
‎you wouldn't do something like this.

271
00:17:20,956 --> 00:17:22,040
‎Goodbye!

272
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:26,378
‎Wait! I came here to dig up
‎the Spring of Drowned Man.

273
00:17:27,671 --> 00:17:29,048
‎Spring of Drowned Man?

274
00:17:30,090 --> 00:17:33,510
‎It's under the girls' locker room?

275
00:17:34,261 --> 00:17:36,429
‎Was that why, Ranma?

276
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:38,514
‎Do these look like the eyes of a liar?

277
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:41,852
‎At least make your lies believable.

278
00:17:42,561 --> 00:17:46,065
‎That was quite the disguise
‎earlier, Ranma.

279
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:48,608
‎That's right.

280
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:52,029
‎I've never dated
‎a woman before in my life.

281
00:17:53,822 --> 00:17:56,824
‎Let alone, received a confession.

282
00:17:56,825 --> 00:18:00,620
‎Not even once in my entire life...

283
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:02,288
‎Did you hear that?

284
00:18:02,289 --> 00:18:03,540
‎Poor guy.

285
00:18:05,292 --> 00:18:06,502
‎What about it?

286
00:18:07,628 --> 00:18:10,546
‎Be honest and tell me, Ranma.

287
00:18:10,547 --> 00:18:14,175
‎Why did you do such an outrageous thing?

288
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:17,303
‎Naturally, it's for
‎the Spring of Drowned Man--

289
00:18:17,304 --> 00:18:19,139
‎Are you saying...

290
00:18:21,475 --> 00:18:23,684
‎that's why you trampled on

291
00:18:23,685 --> 00:18:27,897
‎a man's innocence over and over again?

292
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:29,398
‎Shut up.

293
00:18:29,399 --> 00:18:32,235
‎You're the one who showed me

294
00:18:32,236 --> 00:18:34,488
‎the map to the Spring of Drowned Man!

295
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:41,078
‎Ryoga, is that true?

296
00:18:41,578 --> 00:18:44,748
‎Why would you have a map
‎to the Spring of Drowned Man?

297
00:18:48,502 --> 00:18:50,921
‎Ryoga, don't tell me...

298
00:19:09,064 --> 00:19:10,816
<i>‎My secret's out.</i>

299
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:13,819
‎You were trying to remove Ranma's curse.

300
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:16,405
‎You're such a nice guy.

301
00:19:17,322 --> 00:19:20,325
‎Lucky Akane isn't very sharp, huh, P-chan?

302
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,291
‎Who...

303
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:30,627
‎are you calling P-chan?

304
00:19:32,671 --> 00:19:34,463
‎The Breaking...

305
00:19:34,464 --> 00:19:37,008
‎You're aiming at the wrong target.

306
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:39,887
‎...Point!

307
00:19:55,694 --> 00:19:58,113
‎This sensation is...

308
00:20:03,577 --> 00:20:05,162
‎We did it.

309
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,133
<i>‎The Spring of Drowned Man.</i>

310
00:20:19,051 --> 00:20:20,844
<i>‎It really was here.</i>

311
00:20:22,512 --> 00:20:23,639
‎Hey.

312
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:28,685
‎That Spring of Drowned Man map was
‎the real thing, right?

313
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:32,980
‎Then, why can't I go back to being a man?

314
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,150
‎Say something, you pig!

315
00:20:43,075 --> 00:20:45,534
<i>‎The Japanese Spring of Drowned Man</i>

316
00:20:45,535 --> 00:20:48,955
<i>‎you have patronized
‎for many years has closed.</i>

317
00:20:48,956 --> 00:20:51,499
<i>‎Please visit the original
‎Spring of Drowned Man</i>

318
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:54,127
<i>‎in Jusenkyo, China for your needs.</i>

319
00:20:55,337 --> 00:20:58,298
‎So it was just a normal bathhouse?

320
00:20:58,882 --> 00:21:02,760
‎Hey! Who was it? Who broke the water pipe?

321
00:21:02,761 --> 00:21:04,263
‎Ranma.

322
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,851
‎Where did you get that underwear from?

323
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:12,187
‎I picked it up.

324
00:21:15,482 --> 00:21:19,068
‎What's wrong, P-chan? You're so listless.

325
00:21:19,069 --> 00:21:23,115
‎You'll definitely be much happier
‎staying like this, after all.

326
00:22:57,042 --> 00:23:02,047
